// AWS S3 Object Deletion  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1485
// Detects deletion of S3 objects (DeleteObject/DeleteObjects), a data event. Mass deletion indicates destruction or ransomware. Requires S3…
// False positives: Lifecycle and application cleanup. Baseline per principal/bucket.
// Source: rules/impact/s3-delete-object.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where (eventName in ("DeleteObject", "DeleteObjects")) and eventSource=="s3.amazonaws.com"
